            "DialogCategory": "UILobby",
            "VoiceClip": "Yuuka_(Sportswear)_Lobby_5",
            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0184/CH0184_Lobby_5",
            "LocalizeEN": "When you really think about it...\n\nPhysical education is just another STEM subject that can be scientifically analyzed.\n\nMaybe not in the middle of a run... Or while lifting weights... But outside of that, exercise is nothing but science."
        },
